Package: ppnet
Type: Package
Title: Self-Exciting Point Process Models for Growing Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joseph", "Reps", , "joseph.reps@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Duncan", "Clark", , "dac6@williams.edu", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("cmjt", , , "cmjonestodd@gmail.com", role = "cre"))
Description: Simulates and fits Hawkes process models of network growth by
    maximum likelihood. Events arrive with an exponential self-exciting
    intensity, and each event's marks (new nodes and edges) follow either a
    Barabasi-Albert or a change-statistic attachment kernel, for unipartite
    and bipartite networks.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/cmjt/ppnet
